      "captured_at": "2026-09-09",
      "license_status": "reference_only_not_inferred",
      "verification": "structural",
      "evidence_scope": "official_documentation_review_not_api_test",
      "privacy": "ai_allowed",
      "findings": [
        "Earlier GPT Image models 章节：GPT Image 2 两边为16的倍数，最大边3840，总像素655360至8294400，长短边比不超过3；质量low/medium/high/auto；省略input_fidelity。"
      ],
      "distribution": "metadata_only_original_text_not_included"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IMG-OPENAI-GENERATE-20260909",
      "source_kind": "official",
      "title": "IMG-OPENAI-GENERATE-20260909",
      "url": "https://developers.openai.com/api/reference/resources/images/methods/generate",
      "captured_at": "2026-09-09",
      "license_status": "reference_only_not_inferred",
      "verification": "structural",
      "evidence_scope": "official_documentation_review_not_api_test",
      "privacy": "ai_allowed",
      "findings": [
        "POST /images/generations；prompt最长32000字符；n为1至10；png/jpeg/webp；GPT Image 2透明背景仍为preview，需png或webp。"
      ],
      "distribution": "metadata_only_original_text_not_included"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "IMG-OPENAI-EDIT-20260909",
